---@field sendNoteOnStatusChange? boolean|distilled.Null Whether an internal message should be added when a Linear issue changes status (for status types except completed or canceled).
---@field sendNoteOnComment? boolean|distilled.Null Whether an internal message should be added when someone comments on an issue.
---@field automateTicketReopeningOnCompletion? boolean|distilled.Null Whether a ticket should be automatically reopened when its linked Linear issue is completed.
---@field automateTicketReopeningOnCancellation? boolean|distilled.Null Whether a ticket should be automatically reopened when its linked Linear issue is canceled.
---@field automateTicketReopeningOnComment? boolean|distilled.Null Whether a ticket should be automatically reopened when a comment is posted on its linked Linear issue
---@field disableCustomerRequestsAutoCreation? boolean|distilled.Null [ALPHA] Whether customer and customer requests should not be automatically created when conversations are linked to a Linear issue.
---@field automateTicketReopeningOnProjectCompletion? boolean|distilled.Null Whether a ticket should be automatically reopened when its linked Linear project is completed.
---@field automateTicketReopeningOnProjectCancellation? boolean|distilled.Null Whether a ticket should be automatically reopened when its linked Linear project is canceled.
---@field enableAiIntake? boolean|distilled.Null Whether Linear Agent should be enabled for this integration.
