---@field eq? number|distilled.Null Matches the given value.
---@field neq? number|distilled.Null Excludes the given value.
---@field ["in"]? number[]|distilled.Null Values to include in the match. For scalar comparisons, matches any listed value. An empty list matches nothing.
---@field nin? number[]|distilled.Null Values to exclude from the match. For scalar comparisons, an empty list adds no restriction.
---@field lt? number|distilled.Null Matches values less than the given value.
---@field lte? number|distilled.Null Matches values less than or equal to the given value.
---@field gt? number|distilled.Null Matches values greater than the given value.
---@field gte? number|distilled.Null Matches values greater than or equal to the given value.

